  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s0: a host probe stops failing or tmux becomes usable
  s0 --> s1: a message arrives
  s1 --> s2: a message reserves a new execution
  s2 --> s3: the host creates it
  s2 --> s4: the host server ends
  s3 --> s6: its pane is recorded
  s4 --> s5: the host server starts again
  s5 --> s7: the host creates it
  s6 --> s8: the provider starts in the pane
  s7 --> s9: dcserver stops
  s8 --> s10: the turn binds the execution
  s9 --> s11: dcserver starts
  s10 --> s12: an end is requested
  s11 --> s13: intake opens
  s12 --> s14: the close is sent
  s13 --> s13: the census finds its pane
  s14 --> s15: a cancel is requested
  s13 --> s16: the turn is refused: no provider, or its first prompt already taken
  s15 --> s17: a message arrives
  s16 --> s13: a message arrives
  s17 --> s18: the cancel is delivered or dropped
  s13 --> s19: the turn is refused: no provider, or its first prompt already taken
  s18 --> s20: the owned provider is confirmed gone
  s20 --> s21: the row is retired
  s21 --> s22: a message reserves a new execution
  s22 --> s23: the host server ends
  s23 --> s24: the create reply is lost
  s24 --> s25: the census finds nothing and closes the row
  s25 --> s26: the host server starts again
  s26 --> s27: a message reserves a new execution
  s27 --> s28: the host creates it
  s28 --> s29: dcserver stops
  s29 --> s30: dcserver starts
  s30 --> s30: the census finds its pane
  s30 --> s31: intake opens
  s31 --> s32: the turn is refused: no provider, or its first prompt already taken
  s32 --> s32: the provider starts in the pane
